<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan yarn rates unchanged, seen stable.</title>
<headline>Pakistan yarn rates unchanged, seen stable.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates were unchanged on Thursday and are likely to remain steady in line with the international market, dealers said.</p>
<p>Rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for a 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:</p>
<p>				     Thursday     Previous</p>
<p>    Al-Karam (A.K.)	    470	    470</p>
<p>    Popular (Shabaz)	   455	    455</p>
<p>    Din Tex.		     465	    470</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees) -- Amir Zia 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
